// How many kept pairs sit on the smallest labeled margin.
// No pair returns nothing. Equal margins count every pair.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mlow ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mlow rank

IMPULSE mlow 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mlow" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
